                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game had the potential to be good, but the terrible controls and physics and questionable level design hold it back. The difficulty curve is all over the place, with some levels being trivial and others demanding unreasonable precision. The medal requirements for unlocking levels feel too strict, often forcing you to play perfectly just to get enough medals to progress. And on top of all that, keyboard controls make the game significantly easier, despite the game recommending you use a controller.",
